  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/505704/diamond-spheres-invention-and-ingenuity?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Invention &amp; Ingenuity</a></sup></p>\n<p>When you use dredge, you can choose one of the following options to apply to the area:</p>\n<p><strong>Rigid Terrain:</strong> Creatures within the dredged area suffer a -1 penalty to AC and Reflex saves and are unable to benefit from dodge bonuses. This penalty increases by 1 for every 6 associated ranks you possess.</p>\n<p><strong>Yielding Terrain:</strong> Creatures within the dredged area gain a +1 dodge bonus to AC and Reflex saves and retain any dodge bonus to AC whenever they would lose their Dexterity to AC. This bonus increases by 1 for every 6 associated ranks you possess.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/survivalism#toc55\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
